    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="2.1a">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVEg">IV Eg</ref> 2.1a</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Stande þonne mid Englum þæt ic ⁊ mine witan to minra yldrena domum geyhton, eallum leodscype to ðearfe.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Among the English, however, the additions which I and my councillors have made to the laws of my ancestors shall be observed, for the benefit of the whole nation.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Stande þonne mid Anglum þæt ic ⁊ mine witan to minra yldrena domum geyhton, eallum leodscipe to þearfe.</ab>
      </div>
